    "original_requirement": "构建一个公共卫生间节水控制系统，使用红外接近传感器 D2、水流电磁阀 D10、超声波液位模块 HC-SR04（Trig=D8，Echo=D9）用于水箱液位、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、蜂鸣器 D6 和 LED D13。检测到用户接近时开启水阀固定时长；如果水箱液位过低则禁止出水并报警；数码管显示剩余水位百分比和今日使用次数，串口可查询统计信息。",
    "effective_requirement": "构建一个公共卫生间节水控制系统，使用红外接近传感器 D2、水流电磁阀 D10、超声波液位模块 HC-SR04（Trig=D8，Echo=D9）用于水箱液位、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、蜂鸣器 D6 和 LED D13。检测到用户接近时开启水阀固定时长；如果水箱液位过低则禁止出水并报警；数码管显示剩余水位百分比和今日使用次数，串口可查询统计信息。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"ultrasonic\", \"trigger_pin\": \"D8\", \"echo_pin\": \"D9\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
